[PrintTextModified Text:由于监牢宅邸坐落在高台上，<br>远处望去尽是高墙。|#0201Adv16_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在凝视围墙的同时，<br>诺亚的眼睛渐渐闪耀起来。|#0201Adv16_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好～高啊。<br>可以画很多很多画呢～|#0201Adv16_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我之前也出去过几次，<br>探索了周围。|#0201Adv16_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来，高高的围墙似乎环绕着整个岛屿，<br>恐怕非常难以逃脱。|#0201Adv16_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

