[PrintTextModified Text:（不可能轻易让我们逃脱吧）|#0201Adv16_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——就在这时。|#0201Adv16_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

