[PrintTextModified Text:呃！|#0201Adv16_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:失去平衡的奈叶香<br>摔倒在地。|#0201Adv16_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……我运动能力还可以吧。|#0201Adv16_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么要突然袭击我？<br>根据你的回答，我可能会把你交给看守。|#0201Adv16_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,0 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,25 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香不甘心地爬起上身，<br>保持单膝跪地的姿势，低声说道。|#0201Adv16_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我只是想触碰你而已。<br>并没有要伤害你的意思。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:触碰？那能有什么用。|#0201Adv16_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我的魔法是【幻视】。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:能看到触碰对象的过去或未来的景象。<br>不过，这个魔法并不能随意发动……|#0201Adv16_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……原来如此。|#0201Adv16_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（话说回来，明明可以不用这种<br>　容易树敌的方式去触碰别人……）|#0201Adv16_Hiro008|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这与她给人的印象不符，显得很笨拙。<br>　是因为不太习惯和人周旋吗……？）|#0201Adv16_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我大致明白了。|#0201Adv16_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:突然被关在这样的监牢里，<br>你却能保持如此冷静，肯定是有原因的。|#0201Adv16_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……正如你所察觉的。<br>我通过【幻视】提前看到了监牢的信息。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想问你几个问题。<br>你那把枪是怎么一回事？<br>只要你告诉我，就不追究你刚才的袭击了。|#0201Adv16_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我看到，过去监牢内的囚犯用魔法制作了这把枪，并隐藏了起来。<br>所以，被抓来这里后，我马上就把它收走了。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这把魔法步枪可装填六发子弹，<br>并且每天都会自动恢复一颗子弹。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka007| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（原来如此……在这座监牢里，能掌握信息优势<br>　确实是很大的强项……）|#0201Adv16_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很有趣。还知道些什么吗？|#0201Adv16_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我回答你关于枪的问题，你就不追究我的袭击，这不是说好的吗？<br>我不会再回答更多问题。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但你也可能在撒谎。|#0201Adv16_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你觉得撒谎<br>对我有什么好处？|#0201Adv16_Nanoka009| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:谁知道呢。不过谨慎点总没错。<br>毕竟我们才刚认识。|#0201Adv16_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两人沉默，对视数秒，<br>最后，奈叶香像是放弃了似的叹了口气。|#0201Adv16_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……好吧。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka010| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我会告诉你我警惕的人的魔法。<br>但我无法证明，你得自己去验证。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka011| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那个人的名字是【佐伯米莉亚】……<br>她是我到目前为止最警惕的对象。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka012| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香皱着眉头开始讲述，<br>就像是在回忆什么令人不快的事情。|#0201Adv16_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她……不，那家伙甚至不是少女。<br>——是恶魔。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka013| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她原本拥有【互换】的魔法。<br>目前是一个男性用魔法夺取了她的身体。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka014| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ひとりごと風にぼそりと

[PrintTextModified Text:那家伙一定就是【幕后黑手】……|#0201Adv16_Nanoka015| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着奈叶香如此厌恶地讲述，<br>我明白她所说的一切都不是谎言。|#0201Adv16_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……确实，这是很重要的事实。<br>你知道那个男性的身份吗？|#0201Adv16_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只能看到一些片段，所以详细情况我也不清楚。<br>那家伙是个夺取少女身体的极恶之徒，<br>我看到的只有这些。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka016| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……虽然她说是亲眼所见，但既然只是片段信息，<br>　还是只信一半比较好）|#0201Adv16_Hiro018|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我明白了。我相信你。<br>感谢你提供的有价值的信息。|#0201Adv16_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且你试图接近我，<br>说明你还有不知道的信息。|#0201Adv16_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我顺便问一下，你从一开始<br>就怀疑我吗？|#0201Adv16_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你最初的行动让人摸不着头脑。<br>老实说，我曾经怀疑你是幕后黑手。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka017| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,Arms3

[PrintTextModified Text:绝无可能。|#0201Adv16_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:依我看，你的行动<br>才更加可疑。|#0201Adv16_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:迅速回收枪支的行动，以及你那下定决心的表情。<br>就像是事先准备好了行动计划一样。|#0201Adv16_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我双臂交叉，俯视着她说着，<br>与奈叶香阴郁的眼神交汇。|#0201Adv16_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再追问也是徒劳的。我不打算与你合作。<br>……反正，大家都会死。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka018| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（大家都会死？<br>　她是通过幻视得到这个信息的吗……？）|#0201Adv16_Hiro025|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们互相瞪视着，谁都不愿退让，<br>紧张的气氛弥漫开来。|#0201Adv16_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:喂喂，希罗。|#0201Adv16_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:打破这种紧张气氛的<br>是诺亚。|#0201Adv16_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,Arms1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:她似乎没有注意到发生了什么，<br>拉了拉我的袖子。|#0201Adv16_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:难道说只有在放风时间<br>才能画画吗？|#0201Adv16_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……很遗憾。<br>画画只能在放风时间进行。|#0201Adv16_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸——|#0201Adv16_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚失望地耷拉下脑袋，<br>但很快又抬了起来。|#0201Adv16_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……如果没有和希罗约定的话，<br>诺亚可能会一直躲在房间里画画。|#0201Adv16_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:但是多亏了希罗，<br>诺亚发现了好多好多有趣的地方！|#0201Adv16_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，希罗！<br>诺亚画画时会遵守约定的！|#0201Adv16_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……是吗。那就好。|#0201Adv16_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:不知什么时候奈叶香已经站了起来。<br>不过，她似乎不打算再对我出手了。|#0201Adv16_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……看来你不是坏人。|#0201Adv16_Nanoka019| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

