[PrintTextModified Text:"（看起来比监牢宅邸要新一些。<br>　似乎没怎么使用过——）|#0201Adv16_Hiro029|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗！我们进去看看吧。|#0201Adv16_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
[PrintTextModified Text:……也好。如果门没锁的话，我也想看看。|#0201Adv16_Hiro030| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

