[PrintTextModified Text:我们才刚认识不久嘛，<br>希望你别那么追根究底啦～|#0201Adv16_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:我对你没兴趣，所以也不打算追问那么多。|#0201Adv16_Hiro033| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，真讨厌。话说回来，<br>希罗亲有在看我的直播吗？<br>我从到这第一天就在播了哦。|#0201Adv16_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:直播……嗯，看过了。|#0201Adv16_Hiro034| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就这么点感想啊。|#0201Adv16_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没什么特别的感想。|#0201Adv16_Hiro035| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:回想起第一天的直播，<br>她并不像是在向我们传达什么，<br>而是一直在重复一些奇怪的言行。|#0201Adv16_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:老实说虽然有点在意，<br>但她也不是我想过多接触的类型。|#0201Adv16_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……明天可是有重大发表的，<br>到时候你一定会为我着迷的！|#0201Adv16_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:绝对要看哦！|#0201Adv16_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她这番意味深长的话莫名地让我在意，<br>我故意摇了摇头。|#0201Adv16_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还是算了吧。<br>要是被施了什么奇怪的法术就麻烦了。|#0201Adv16_Hiro036| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不知道你的魔法是什么，<br>说不定和直播有关。<br>万一看了就被洗脑了呢。|#0201Adv16_Hiro037| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:才不是洗脑呢！<br>我的魔法是【千里眼】！|#0201Adv16_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:千里眼……？|#0201Adv16_Hiro038| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:可可似乎意识到自己不小心说漏嘴了，<br>尴尬地移开了视线。|#0201Adv16_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:糟糕说漏嘴了……不、不过也行吧。<br>反正被知道了也不会少块肉……|#0201Adv16_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:无论通过直播还是照片，只要有人认知到了泽渡可可这个人，<br>我就能俯瞰到正在观察我的人。|#0201Adv16_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:意思就是说，你能获得这座监牢外面的信息吗？|#0201Adv16_Hiro039| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:差不多吧？只要有人在某处看着我就行？|#0201Adv16_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，通过我的千里眼，<br>还获得了一个超～厉害的情报哦～|#0201Adv16_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么样，我的魔法很厉害吧？<br>——记得看直播哦。|#0201Adv16_Coco014| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可离开了招待所。|#0201Adv16_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Coco Category:Profile Version:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:62 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:至于诺亚……正在拿典狱长模样的摆件玩耍。<br>我深深地叹了口气。|#0201Adv16_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

